[Claim 1]
A drain water inspection device for use in an indoor unit of an air-conditioning system that includes a drain pump capable of draining water from inside the drain pan and a float switch that switches between ON and OFF states in response to the water level within the drain pan, comprising:
a battery housing section capable of removably holding a plurality of batteries;
a battery connector section capable of electrically connecting a mobile battery;
a voltage conversion section that can convert the output voltage of the at least one battery held in the battery housing section and the output voltage of the mobile battery connected to the battery connector section into the drive voltage for the drain pump;
a pump connector section that is electrically connectable to the drain pump and electrically connected to the voltage conversion section;
a pump drive switch that electrically connects the voltage conversion section and the pump connector section when the switch is in ON state, and electrically disconnects them when the switch is in OFF state;
a switch connector section that is electrically connectable to the float switch and is electrically connected to the battery housing section and battery connector section; and
a first notification section capable of indicating the state of the float switch.
The drain water inspection device is configured such that when the drain pump is connected to the pump connector section and the pump drive switch is in ON state, the drain pump receives either the output voltage of the at least one battery or the output voltage of the mobile battery via the voltage conversion section, and when the float switch is connected to the switch connector section and is in ON state, the float switch receives either the output voltage of the at least one battery or the output voltage of the mobile battery.

blocks.correction:
A drain water inspection device to be used for an indoor unit of an air conditioner that includes a drain pump capable of draining water from inside a drain pan and a float switch that switches between an ON state and an OFF state in accordance with a water level in the drain pan, the device comprising:
a battery housing section capable of removably holding at least one battery;
a battery connector section to which a mobile battery can be electrically connected;
a voltage conversion section that can convert an output voltage of the at least one battery held in the battery housing section and an output voltage of the mobile battery connected to the battery connector section into a drive voltage for the drain pump;　　
a pump connector section to which the drain pump can be electrically connected and which is electrically connected to the voltage conversion section;
a pump drive switch that electrically connects the voltage conversion section and the pump connector section when in an ON state, and electrically disconnects the voltage conversion section and the pump connector section when in an OFF state;
a switch connector section to which the float switch can be electrically connected and which is electrically connected to the battery housing section and the battery connector section; and
a first reporting section capable of reporting a state of the float switch, wherein
when the drain pump is connected to the pump connector section and the pump drive switch is in the ON state, either the output voltage of the at least one battery or the output voltage of the mobile battery is supplied to the drain pump via the voltage conversion section, and
when the float switch is connected to the switch connector section and is in the ON state, either the output voltage of the at least one battery or the output voltage of the mobile battery is supplied to the float switch.
